<http://data.silknow.org/object/69c12880-239f-3b11-9a05-2ecd011bfc9b/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Woven silk satin and metal thread  silk, bordered by woven silk, backed with roller printed cotton and faced with silk satin.\nDark pink-red satin ground woven with blue, yellow, green and white and silver thread with alternating rows of carnations and stylised quatrefoil flower heads; these motifs are interspersed with small stars.\nBorder: an off-white silk ground woven with pink irises and scrolling green stems and leaves with a continuous link, with narrow bands of small flowers in dark brown and beige.\nFacing: bias cut blue sating.\nBacking: pieced; plain weave off-white cotton printed in red with alternating daisies and small floral sprigs."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/69c12880-239f-3b11-9a05-2ecd011bfc9b> .

