        rdfs:comment                   "Woven silk satin and metal thread  silk, bordered by woven silk, backed with roller printed cotton and faced with silk satin.\nDark pink-red satin ground woven with blue, yellow, green and white and silver thread with alternating rows of carnations and stylised quatrefoil flower heads; these motifs are interspersed with small stars.\nBorder: an off-white silk ground woven with pink irises and scrolling green stems and leaves with a continuous link, with narrow bands of small flowers in dark brown and beige.\nFacing: bias cut blue sating.\nBacking: pieced; plain weave off-white cotton printed in red with alternating daisies and small floral sprigs."@en ;
